  "title": "embecta Announces Quarterly Cash Dividend",
  "summary": "PARSIPPANY, N.J., Aug. 07, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- The Board of Directors of Embecta Corp. (“embecta”) (Nasdaq: EMBC) has declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.01 for each issued and outstanding share of the Company’s common stock. The dividend is payable on September 15, 2026 to stockholders",
